silm:instances_papers_01_orientation_chapters_13_regression_test_suite_sections_01_probe_catus_collision_yoneda_hom_leg_1 silm:hasExample "In 'ProbeCatusCollisionLegLambdaTax', the typed legs of the Yoneda hom-profile are witnessed by concrete Mittens-domain arrows. For example, gippidy00 §1 lines 97-105: the collision list establishes that TSN 183798 is the unique canonical row; JoC §6.20 licenses the Yoneda-unique identification arrow." .
